  "description": "The Willow 8i Disc is Brooklyn Bicycle Co.'s most fully equipped step-through bike, designed for riders who want everything included from day one. A Shimano Nexus 8-speed internal hub keeps shifting smooth and maintenance low, while Hydraulic disc brakes deliver reliable stopping power in any weather. The step-through aluminum frame offers effortless mounting and a relaxed upright riding position that keeps long rides comfortable. Integrated front and rear fenders and a chain guard come standard, so the Willow is ready for commuting, errands, and weekend exploration right out of the box. Puncture-resistant tires handle rough roads without worry. The Willow 8i Disc is built for riders who do not want to think about their bike, they just want to ride it.",
